   "title": "Downloads + requirements",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Downloads · put each file in the folder shown\n\nInside `ComfyUI/models/`. Click a file name to download it.\n\n| Folder | File (click = download) | Size |\n|---|---|---|\n| `diffusion_models/` | [minimax_h3_image_pruned_w4a8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_image_pruned_w4a8.safetensors) | 12.5 GB |\n| `text_encoders/` | [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3-Image/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors) | 15.7 GB |\n| `vae/` | [minimax_h3_image_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3-Image/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_image_vae_fp16.safetensors) | 1.2 GB |\n\nTotal: 29.4 GB. Both AI Influencer workflows use the same three files. If you already run MiniMax H3 video, you have the text encoder.\n\n**Custom nodes: none.** Core nodes only.\n\n## Requirements\n- **GPU:** 12 GB VRAM tested (peak about 11.6 GB).\n- **RAM:** 32 GB tested (peak about 17 GB for text to image, about 21 to 22 GB with pictures).\n- **ComfyUI:** 0.45.0 tested. Older versions do not have the MiniMax H3 Image node.\n\n_Tested on: RTX 3060 12 GB · Ryzen 5 5600X · 32 GB RAM · ComfyUI 0.45.0 · Windows 11._\n\nMiniMax H3 Image is released under the MiniMax-H3-Image Community License Agreement.\n"
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
